            "review_title": "Review at Phung Vy - Hai San",
            "review_text": "Teekeon\nHanoi, Vietnam131 contributions\n0\nGood honest seafood restaurant\nMay 2016 • Friends\nThere are many seafood restaurants to choose from. Many have better ambience and are at easier to access locations - but I keep coming back to Phung Vy because of the the food. Honest cooking, reasonable prices and consistency. It has its own local charm and doesnt pretend to be anything that it isn't. Go try.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2016",
