            "review_title": "Review at Phung Vy - Hai San",
            "review_text": "hominglamb\nHong Kong, China10 contributions\n0\nIt's not cheap but quality assured\nFeb 2016 • Friends\nWe had a dinner for 3 with kind of over 1600k dinner, it's not cheap but versus what I heard in market (cheating) they're providing what u need. The mud crab is one of the best crabs I had tried for years. Prawns maybe too pricy, rest of dishes are affordable. Cooking style is much Chinese like.\nWritten February 20, 2016",
